WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.150
Hi, I'm Kate, a Lead Product Designer in fintech and payments.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:13.400
I design the UX and UI end to end. After years in Figma, I now build the interface in code with AI.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.000
In our call, I'll show you the full picture: one journey, from seller to buyer.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:26.830
First, the seller: creating a product with its own product page and payment link, ready to share or place anywhere.

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:33.060
Then the buyer: the product page, checkout, and managing the order in the Order portal.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:41.190
Along the way, I'll walk you through the key UX decisions behind each step, including what happens when something goes wrong.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:47.790
I'll also show how I work with my team, from the journey map to working prototypes in code.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.020
Thanks for watching, and see you soon!
